            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>HEVC, H.264 and ProRes video plays straight off your iPhone or iPad, whatever its size. Press Space: nothing is copied first, and the 2 GB limit is gone for a single .mov, .mp4 or .m4v that macOS can play.</li>
<li>A large video that can’t be read right now says so, instead of “too large to preview”.</li>
<li>Version numbers now start from 0.9 ahead of Shuttle’s 1.0 launch. This is newer than 1.0.6.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
